        <mxCell id="Bl2zOD2f_C1R0rvK7kQ3-28" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;movable=0;resizable=0;rotatable=0;deletable=0;editable=0;locked=1;connectable=0;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Lucida Console;fontColor=light-dark(#000000,#FFFFFF);" value="$$ \eta = \frac{\text{Message Signal Power}}{\text{Total AM Power}} =&amp;nbsp; \frac{P_{SB}}{P_{AM}} = \frac{ P_{LSB} + P_{USB}}{P_{C} + P_{LSB} + P_{USB}}&amp;nbsp; \space \Rightarrow&amp;nbsp; \\ \\&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;\eta = \frac{\frac{1}{4} \cdot \mu^2 A^2_c}{P_c \big[1 + \frac{\mu^2}{2} \big]} = \frac{\frac{A^2_c}{2} \cdot \frac{\mu^2}{2}}{\frac{A^2_c}{2} \big[1 + \frac{\mu^2}{2} \big]} = \frac{\mu^2}{2 \space \big[ 1 + \frac{\mu^2}{2} \big]} \space \Rightarrow&amp;nbsp; \\ \\&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;\eta = \frac{\mu^2}{2 + \mu^2} $$" vertex="1">
